      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹60.19 (vs ₹67.87 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹60.19 (down from ₹67.87 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹11.2b (up 15% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹756.7m (down 11% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 6.7% (down from 8.7% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 25% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 6% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
